{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a train shrouded in endless darkness. The doors between cars are sealed, your sanity is slipping, and the only light you have is fading fast. To stop the nightmare, you must venture through each car, scavenging mysterious artifacts to unlock the way forward. But you\u2019re not alone. A monster stalks the corridors, hunting by sound and vibration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is a balance between conserving your precious light, keeping your mind intact, and staying one step ahead of the horrors that lurk in the shadows. Reach the driver\u2019s seat, pull the final lever, and bring the train to a halt\u2014before you become another lost passenger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror on Rails</strong> \u2013 Explore the train cars cloaked in oppressive darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity &amp; Light Management</strong> \u2013 Keep your lantern powered and your mind steady, or risk succumbing to the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Tension</strong> \u2013 Evade the blind monster that track you through noise and movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Challenge</strong> \u2013 Collect strange MacGuffins in each car to unlock the next, with growing danger in every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong> \u2013 A claustrophobic, surreal setting with chilling audio design and an ever-present sense of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to ride the <strong>Nightmare Train</strong> to its end?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983700?t=1759155848","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets