ar to unlock the next, with growing danger in every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong> \u2013 A claustrophobic, surreal setting with chilling audio design and an ever-present sense of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to ride the <strong>Nightmare Train</strong> to its end?</p>","developers":["Gaia"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983700/87666e17fbeaec95805bbec2121aed40dc1840c0/header.jpg?t=1759155848","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3983700/2109155165/7adedeaa7a12f37d7bab8a78c1e3f789d8282274/1756215306/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757974291","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3983700/2109155165/7adedeaa7a12f37d7bab8a78c1e3f789d8282274/1756215306/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757974291","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3983700/2109155165/7adedeaa7a12f37d7bab8a78c1e3f789d8282274/1756215306/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757974291","id":257189163,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189163/movie480.mp4?t=1757974291","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189163/movie_max.mp4?t=1757974291"},"name":"Cinematic","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189163/7991d833f19cfc027768560ad914f8365664e5d2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757974291","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189163/m